@startuml 13-booking-statuses
!include _style.iuml
title Booking statuses

[*] --> PENDING_PAYMENT : guest books\n(rooms held 15 min)
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CONFIRMED : payment succeeded
PENDING_PAYMENT --> EXPIRED : hold ran out\n(timer relabels every minute)
EXPIRED --> CONFIRMED : late payment and\nrooms still free ("revive")
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : guest or admin cancels\n(no money moves)
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : guest, host or admin cancels\n(refund by policy)
CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED : check-out before today\n(hotel time zone, hourly timer)
CANCELLED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*] : guest may review

note right of PENDING_PAYMENT
  Counts against availability only while
  holdExpiresAt > now. Queries ignore an
  expired hold at once, before the timer runs.
  A guest may hold at most 2 unpaid bookings.
end note
note right of CONFIRMED
  Counts against availability.
  Price, listing title, location and
  cover image are snapshotted.
end note
@enduml
